  "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Asset type: Japanese elementary vocabulary illustrations, sheet 49. Edit the provided 2048x2048 template, painting ONLY inside its sixteen white panels. Every single panel MUST have identical width and height. All horizontal lines must be EXACTLY at 0%,25%,50%,75%,100%, not based on artwork. Keep precisely the 4x4 equal grid and 5 continuous pure magenta #ff00ff lines in each direction, including outer frame. Preserve line position, width and full canvas. Each panel is an independent clear gentle picture-book illustration as isolated vignettes on a pure white background, large and easily understood. Never use magenta for illustration. Avoid all pink, purple and neon colors in artwork, objects, decorations, lighting and shadows. Use warm orange, red, yellow, green, blue and neutral colors. No pink/purple concert lights. Nothing crosses the grid. No text, letters, numbers, labels, symbols resembling writing or watermarks. For abstract words show a concrete situation illustrating the meaning. Diverse natural children and adults, no stereotypes. Correct anatomy and objects. Panels in strict row-major order (left to right, top to bottom):\n1. 作家 — 小説などの作品を作る仕事の人。\n2. 錯覚 — 実際とは違うように見えたり感じたりすること。\n3. 作曲家 — 音楽の曲を作る仕事の人。\n4. サッシ — 窓などのガラスをはめる枠。\n5. サファイア — 青色などの美しい色をした宝石。\n6. サブタイトル — 本題を補うもう一つの題名。\n7. サポーター — チームなどを応援して支える人。\n8. 妨げ — 物事が進むのを邪魔するもの。\n9. 寒気 — 体がぞくぞくして寒く感じること。\n10. 寒さ — 寒いと感じる度合い。\n11. 再来週 — 来週の次の週。\n12. 参加者 — 催しや活動などに加わる人。\n13. 参考 — 考えたり調べたりするときの手掛かりにすること。\n14. 参考書 — 学習などで説明や資料を参考にする本。\n15. 散策 — 景色などを楽しみながら歩くこと。\n16. 山荘 — 山の中などにある宿や別荘。\nSafety and clarity: Vehicles must be driven only by unmistakable adults, never children. Industrial machinery and knives are used by adults. Do not put a child in a car driver's seat. Keep artwork separated by the measured template grid.\nDo not add numerical claims, prices, quantities, currency denominations, calorie values or stroke-order numbers unless explicitly required by the target word. Mathematical concepts should have neutral concrete examples without unverified numeric diagrams.\n",
